{"sha": "6177b42e7b55435a61f6e861817311d4149c2687a3e6fd2509d440028c5128f0", "body": ["\\emph{调和性}：取 $z = r\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi}$，", "\\[", "u(z) = \\operatorname{Re}\\biggl[\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_0^{2\\pi}", "\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu t} + z}{\\eu^{\\iu t} - z}\\,", "g(\\eu^{\\iu t})\\,\\dd t\\biggr],", "\\]", "（方括号中的核的实部为 $P_r(\\varphi - t)$：", "计算），且方括号式关于 $z$ 在 $\\mathbb D$ 上全纯", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:holomorphic:7}）：$u$ 是一个", "全纯函数的实部，因此为调和函数。", "", "\\emph{边界值}：$P_r(\\cdot)$ 是", "当 $r \\to 1^-$ 时的近似恒等式：总质量为 $1$，且对 $\\delta \\leq", "\\abs\\theta \\leq \\pi$, $P_r(\\theta) \\leq \\frac{1 - r^2}{1 -", "2r\\cos\\delta + r^2} \\to 0$，且一致成立。标准的分拆", "（$g$ 在 $\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi_0}$ 附近的连续性，", "其余处的有界性）给出 $u(r\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi}) \\to", "g(\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi_0})$，当 $r\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} \\to", "\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi_0}$ 时，且对边界点一致，", "所得延拓是连续的。\\emph{唯一性}：两解之差", "在 $\\mathbb D$ 上调和，在", "闭包上连续，在边界上为零：由最大值原理", "（作用于 $\\pm$ 差）知差恒为零。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\clip (-2.1,-2.1) rectangle (2.1,2.1);", "    \\foreach \\c in {0.2, 0.5, 0.8, 1.1, 1.4}{", "      \\draw[omDef!60] plot[domain=-2.05:2.05, samples=80]", "        (\\x, {\\c/(2*\\x)});", "      \\draw[omDef!60] plot[domain=-2.05:2.05, samples=80]", "        (\\x, {-\\c/(2*\\x)});", "      \\draw[omThm!60, samples=80, domain=\\c:2.9]", "        plot ({sqrt((\\x*\\x-\\c*\\c)/1)/1}, {0}) ;", "    }", "    % hyperbolas x^2 - y^2 = c", "    \\foreach \\c in {0.4, 1, 1.6}{", "      \\draw[omThm!70] plot[domain=-1.32:1.32, samples=60]", "        ({cosh(\\x)*sqrt(\\c)}, {sinh(\\x)*sqrt(\\c)});", "      \\draw[omThm!70] plot[domain=-1.32:1.32, samples=60]", "        ({-cosh(\\x)*sqrt(\\c)}, {sinh(\\x)*sqrt(\\c)});", "    }", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[->] (-2.2,0) -- (2.3,0);", "  \\draw[->] (0,-2.2) -- (0,2.3);", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (1.75,-1.9)", "    {$\\operatorname{Re}z^2 = c$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (-1.35,1.95)", "    {$\\operatorname{Im}z^2 = c$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\operatorname{Re}z^2 = x^2 - y^2$ 的等值线", "（红色双曲线）与 $\\operatorname{Im}z^2 = 2xy$（蓝色", "双曲线）在 $0$ 以外处成直角相交：共形映射", "（$z \\mapsto z^2$，其中 $z \\neq 0$）保持", "坐标线的正交性。在 $z = 0$ 处，", "导数为零，角度反而加倍。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:conformal:1}", "(a) 验证凯莱映射 $\\varphi(z) = \\frac{z -", "\\iu}{z + \\iu}$ 是 $\\mathbb H \\to \\mathbb D$ 的双射，且其逆映射即所给者，", "并求 $\\iu$、$0$、", "$1$、$\\infty$ 的像（取极限）。", "(b) 证明 $z \\mapsto 1/z$ 把圆和直线", "映为圆和直线。\\emph{（写出它们的公共方程", "$\\alpha\\abs z^2 + \\bar\\beta z + \\beta\\bar z + \\gamma = 0$,", "$\\alpha, \\gamma \\in \\R$。）} 由此对所有 M\\\"obius", "映射同样成立。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:conformal:2}", "设 $f \\colon \\mathbb D \\to \\mathbb D$ 为全纯函数。", "(a) 若 $f(0) = 0$，且 $f(a) = a$（某个 $a \\neq 0$），证明 $f", "= \\mathrm{id}$.", "(b) 若 $f$ 为自同构，在", "$\\mathbb D$ 中有两个不同的不动点，证明 $f = \\mathrm{id}$", "\\emph{（用布拉施克因子作共轭，归结为 (a)）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:conformal:3}", "（施瓦茨--皮克）设全纯函数 $f\\colon \\mathbb D \\to", "\\mathbb D$，证明", "\\[", "\\frac{\\abs{f'(z)}}{1 - \\abs{f(z)}^2} \\;\\leq\\;", "\\frac{1}{1 - \\abs z^2}", "\\qquad (z \\in \\mathbb D),", "\\]", "等号成立（在某一点处成立，从而处处成立）当且仅当 $f \\in", "\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb D)$.", "\\emph{（对 $\\varphi_{f(z)}\\circ", "f\\circ\\varphi_{-z}$ 应用施瓦茨引理。）} 解释：全纯自映射", "收缩双曲度量。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:conformal:4}", "求出显式的共形等价映射：", "(a) 带形 $\\{0 < \\operatorname{Im}z < \\pi\\} \\to \\mathbb H$；", "(b) 象限 $\\{\\operatorname{Re}z > 0,", "\\operatorname{Im}z > 0\\} \\to \\mathbb H$;", "(c) 半圆盘 $\\mathbb D\\cap\\mathbb H \\to$ 象限，", "再 $\\to \\mathbb H$；", "(d) 映射 $\\mathbb D \\to \\mathbb D$ 将 $\\frac12$ 映为 $0$，", "且该点处的导数为正。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}